        "imageUrl": "/uploads/slides/slide-solution-modules-6-1771057571613.png",
        "imagePrompt": "Create a professional presentation slide with dark navy blue (#1A2B8C) background. Title in large white bold text: \"ROLEPLAY: DYNAMIC TESTING PITCH\". Show a time comparison visual. Top: \"TRADITIONAL A/B\" with a long timeline bar (4-6 weeks) in gray, even traffic split shown as 50/50. Bottom: \"DYNAMIC TESTING\" with a short timeline bar (1-2 weeks) in magenta (#E84C8A), showing AI shifting traffic from 50/50 to 80/20 as winner emerges. A clock icon showing \"3X FASTER\". Scenario: \"CRO Lead frustrated with 4-6 week test cycles.\" Bottom: \"GOAL: Select 1 journey + ROI measurement.\" Professional speed comparison slide. 16:9 aspect ratio.",
        "narrationScript": "Alright team, let’s dive into an exciting roleplay opportunity that will sharpen your skills in positioning our dynamic testing solution. Imagine you’re sitting across from a Chief Revenue Officer who’s clearly frustrated. They’ve been waiting 4 to 6 weeks to see results from their A/B tests, and that kind of timeline just doesn’t cut it anymore in today’s fast-paced market.\n\nYour mission here is to demonstrate how our dynamic testing solution is the next evolution beyond traditional A/B testing. You want to convey that with the power of AI, we can allocate traffic intelligently and identify winning variations three times faster. This isn’t just about speed; it’s about giving them a competitive edge.\n\nAs you engage in this roleplay, focus on selecting one customer journey to apply dynamic testing to, and make sure to define how you’ll measure ROI. This clarity will help them see the tangible benefits of switching to our solution.\n\nRemember, the key skill to emphasize is your ability to explain AI-optimized traffic allocation in business terms. Your goal is to make it relatable and impactful, so they truly understand how this can revolutionize their testing strategy.\n\nAs we wrap up this exercise, think about how you can carry these insights into your next client interactions. Let’s get started!",
