        "narrationScript": "Alright team, let’s dive into our roleplay scenario focusing on the healthcare vertical, specifically around patient engagement. Imagine you’re in a meeting with a VP of Digital Health. Their primary goal is to boost engagement on their patient portal, but there’s a catch—they can’t expose any Protected Health Information, or PHI. \n\nYour task here is to scope out a compliant optimization initiative that positions Monetate as the go-to HIPAA-ready platform. This is where we want to shine, demonstrating our expertise in navigating compliance while still driving engagement.\n\nAs you engage in this roleplay, remember, your pass criteria is to outline one portal-flow test and define a compliant personalization use case. This is critical! You need to showcase how we can create experiments that never touch PHI, yet still enhance the user experience and optimize engagement.\n\nThink creatively about how our platform can deliver value without compromising sensitive information. This is a great opportunity for you to practice scoping experiments thoughtfully and strategically. \n\nBy the end of this exercise, you should feel confident in articulating how Monetate can meet the unique challenges of the healthcare sector. Let’s get started and really dig into this scenario!",
