        "imagePrompt": "Create a professional presentation slide with dark navy blue (#1A2B8C) background. Title in large white bold text: \"ROLEPLAY: MEDIA & TECH\". Show a SaaS dashboard visual with funnel conversion. Current: \"8% trial-to-paid\" in red. Benchmark: \"15%\" in magenta (#E84C8A). Growth funnel showing where experimentation should expand. Persona: \"VP Growth, SaaS Company.\" Bottom: \"GOAL: Trial-to-paid experiment + retention personalization.\" Professional tech vertical roleplay slide. 16:9 aspect ratio.",
        "narrationScript": "Alright team, let’s dive into an engaging roleplay scenario that will sharpen our skills in vertical selling, specifically in the communications, media, and tech space. \n\nImagine you’re sitting across from the VP of Growth at a SaaS company. They’re facing a challenge: their trial-to-paid conversion rate is sitting at just 8%, while the benchmark is a solid 15%. Right now, their experimentation is limited to tweaking marketing pages, but they know they need to expand their efforts to really drive growth.\n\nYour goal in this roleplay will be to help the VP understand the importance of broadening their experimentation beyond just marketing. You’ll want to emphasize how critical it is to explore the product experience itself. Your pass criteria for this exercise? Develop a robust trial-to-paid experiment plan and outline a retention personalization test that can lead to meaningful insights.\n\nAs you engage in this conversation, focus on connecting product experimentation to those crucial growth metrics. This is where your expertise shines, helping the VP see how strategic changes in the product can lead to higher conversions and retention rates.\n\nRemember, the aim here is not just to sell, but to guide them toward a comprehensive strategy that addresses their current challenges. So, as you roleplay, think about how you can drive that connection and inspire action.\n\nLet’s get started and make this a powerful learning experience!",
